specgen: built by the pinned Idris
the committed files: exit 0, naming nothing
written into an empty tree: each file byte for byte the committed one
generated files no output is: none
a generated file edited by hand: exit 1, naming an output
a comment in the specification: exit 1, naming the manifest
the generator changed, its outputs the same: exit 1, naming the manifest
the specification changed without its outputs: exit 1, naming outputs and the manifest
